{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script", "label": "ADR-018 \u2014 Contrato do bloco Python-Script", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_python_script_block", "label": "Contrato do bloco Python-Script (INx/OUTx/state, math+numpy, exec em executor)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "V\u00e1lvula de escape para l\u00f3gica arbitr\u00e1ria sem inflar a paleta. Portas definidas pelo usu\u00e1rio; entradas IN1..INn e sa\u00eddas OUT1..OUTn injetadas no escopo; dict state persistente entre varreduras (sobrevive a hot-swap, cf. ADR-011); apenas math e numpy dispon\u00edveis; timeout ~70% do Ts com mesma pol\u00edtica do MPC (ADR-014). Execu\u00e7\u00e3o via exec() em namespace controlado rodando em executor, nunca no event loop; modelo de amea\u00e7a = admin autenticado, sem sandboxing pesado. Exce\u00e7\u00e3o: mant\u00e9m \u00faltimas sa\u00eddas + alarme com traceback."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script", "target": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_python_script_block", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script", "target": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_011_hot_swap_sem_versionamento", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "con